homelab-webtheme (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * /favicon.ico in every app is the Silver Linings mark (public/favicon.ico,
    rendered from the theme's favicon.svg at 16/32/48/64), served by the
    plugin ahead of Mojolicious's bundled cloud icon; the head partial links
    it as the shortcut icon for browsers that ignore SVG icons (post-cutover
    #100). The same file is published at static.mailmasker.org/theme/v1/.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:00:00 -0600

homelab-webtheme (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The app launcher (post-cutover #94): a dotted-grid button left of the
    account name opens every mailmasker site as a tile, alphabetical
    (Account, Calendar, Drive, Email, Notes, Search; an app may pass its own
    `sites`), each with an inline icon. The account dropdown keeps the
    address, Settings, the account page and Sign out; the site links moved
    into the launcher. The stylesheet on static.mailmasker.org carries the
    launcher rules; a copy of the live theme files now lives in the repo
    under static/theme/v1/.

 -- Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:05:00 -0600

